 "caption": "ValueError hech narsa aytmaydi. O'z xatoingizni yarating — va asl sababni yo'qotmang 🧩\nSeriya: Python o'rta daraja #5 — try/except'ning davomi, intervyuda ko'p so'raladi\n✅ class BalansXato(Exception) — biznes xato: except bilan aniq ushlanadi, ma'lumotni atributda saqlaydi (e.kerak, e.bor)\n✅ raise ConfigXato(\"port xato\") from e — yangi xato + asl sabab: e.__cause__ = ValueError, traceback'da \"direct cause\"\n✅ from'siz raise → \"During handling ... another exception occurred\" — go'yo except ichida bug bordek ko'rinadi\n⚠️ Exception'dan meros oling, BaseException'dan emas — aks holda except Exception uni ushlamaydi.\n📌 Saqlab qo'ying — Django, requests, SQLAlchemy xatolari aynan shunday qurilgan.\n💬 Savol: raise ... from None nima qiladi? Izohga yozing!\n👉 Har kuni Dasturlash, SQL va Flutter bo'yicha darslar — obuna bo'ling!\n\n#python #pythonintervyu #exception #raise #tryexcept #dasturlash #dasturchi #backend #programming #pythondeveloper #uzbekistan",
